{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642680/extras/re_Welcome_to_Half_Sword_02.png?t=1744654965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Half Sword</strong> is an immersive, physics-based medieval combat simulator that offers players a unique experience of becoming a commoner-turned-knight, <strong>fighting brutal tournaments in 15th-century Europe</strong>. With innovative gameplay mechanics, you can <strong>wield your weapon with precision using your mouse</strong>, feeling the intensity of each clash as you ascend the ranks to face formidable opponents. <br> <br><strong>This is the Demo Version of Half Sword, an incomplete yet representative version of the game! </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>Have fun you beggar!\u00a0</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2642680?t=1744654965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2642680?t=1744654965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642680/930c7bdba350be4dfefd71d10dd1fbffe23e96de/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1744654965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642680/930c7bdba350be4dfefd71d10dd1fbffe23e96de/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1744654965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Our game boasts a robust gore and blood system that leaves a messy and chilling trail in its wake. Witness skull-crushing blows, limb decapitations, and gruesome displays of entrails and bloodshed, all intricately tied to the weapon and armor choices of both you and your opponents."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642680/extras/Join_Discord_HalfSword.png?t=1744654965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642680/extras/re_Welcome_to_Half_Sword_02.png?t=1744654965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Half Sword</strong> is an immersive, physics-based medieval combat simulator that offers players a unique experience of becoming a commoner-turned-knight, <strong>fighting brutal tournaments in 15th-century Europe</strong>. With innovative gameplay mechanics, you can <strong>wield your weapon with precision using your mouse</strong>, feeling the intensity of each clash as you ascend the ranks to face formidable opponents. <br> <br><strong>This is the Demo Version of Half Sword, an incomplete yet representative version of the game! </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>Have fun you beggar!\u00a0</strong></p>","developers":["Half Sword Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2397300","name":"Half Sword"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642680/b4eb5951550203119cf935e85b28825d3f96f7ee/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1744654965","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123494,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123494/movie480.mp4?t=1744191031","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai